{"id":"concept-意义","slug":"意义","entityType":"concept","name":"意义","originalTerms":["meaning","Bedeutung"],"summary":"后期维特根斯坦说，在一大类情形中，一个词的意义就是它在语言中的使用。这条限定要求从具体语言活动出发，不把意义设想为词背后隐藏的对象。","senses":[{"traditionId":"tradition-分析哲学","label":"意义","explanation":"意义与使用相连，并不废除定义、指称或解释；问题是这些做法各自在何种语言游戏中起作用。", "citations":[{"sourceId":"src-wittgenstein-investigations-anscombe","locator":"§§1–43","claim":"支持意义即使用及其“在一大类情形中”的限定。"}]}],"personIds":["wittgenstein"],"workIds":["tractatus","philosophical-investigations"],"traditionIds":["tradition-分析哲学"],"sourceIds":["src-wittgenstein","src-wittgenstein-investigations-anscombe"],"citations":[{"sourceId":"src-wittgenstein","locator":"Sections 3.2–3.3","claim":"支持后期意义理论相对于早期图像理论的转变。"}],"contentTier":"standard","editorialStatus":"published","version":2,"editedBy":"思想星图编辑组","reviewedBy":"source-structure-review/journey-batch-v1","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-05","notes":"保留“在一大类情形中”的范围限定。"}
